  "task": {
    "objective": "Score by uncontested live signal coverage of an owned plot. Team reward is own minus opponent step points divided by four, less each actor non-wait cost 1/128.",
    "natural_termination": "Either team reaches 24 accumulated plot points; otherwise truncate at 80. Simultaneous threshold crossings are possible.",
    "interaction": "One mobile relay per team must be carried, pulsed, guarded, jammed or returned to recharge. Guarding blocks opposing drain and extends a new pulse; pickup can remove a teammate access to the same relay. Competing signals change control and scoring.",
    "observation_access": "Public static map, IDs/team mapping, clock and team totals. Agent and plot details are local L1 radius 3. Native relay/signal telemetry is global to its own team; enemy telemetry is local radius 3. All hidden payloads zero with explicit visible flags. Events publish only total points."
